{"id":"8a29fc853b841c25","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-vector-field.md","title":"Vector Field","display":"df-vector-field — Vector Field","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-vector-field","aliases":["58-df-vector-field","Vector Field"],"display":"df-vector-field — Vector Field","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-vector-field"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-vector-field</span><span>Vector Field</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vector-field — Vector Field"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4aec613831b7dd67\" href=\"?note=4aec613831b7dd67\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md\">../batch19/58-df-tangent.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\in V\">\\(X,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M)=C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M)=C^\\infty(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A;\\mathbb R)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_pM=T_p(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\">\\(T_pM=T_p(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A)\\)</span>，均使用所引文件的指定结构接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_pM\">\\(T_pM\\)</span> 不是任意选择的一组三元切空间谓词见证。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak X(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\">\\(\\mathfrak X(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X[f]\">\\(X[f]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[X,Y]\">\\([X,Y]\\)</span> 是下式给出的函数集合及函数图。在这些记号中始终沿用同一组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\">\\((M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothVectorField}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothVectorField}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorField}_S(X,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\land X\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}T_pM\\right)^M\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;X(p)\\in T_pM\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M)\\;\n\\{\\langle p,X(p)(f)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}\\in C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorField}_S(X,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\land X\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}T_pM\\right)^M\\land\\forall p\\in M\\;X(p)\\in T_pM\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M)\\;\n\\{\\langle p,X(p)(f)\\rangle:p\\in M\\}\\in C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathfrak X(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\coloneqq\\left\\{X\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}T_pM\\right)^M:\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorField}_S(X,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\right\\},\\\\\nX\\in\\mathfrak X(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land f\\in C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M)\\to\nX[f]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,X(p)(f)\\rangle:p\\in M\\},\\\\\nX,Y\\in\\mathfrak X(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\to\n[X,Y]\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left\\langle p,\n\\{\\langle f,X(p)(Y[f])-Y(p)(X[f])\\rangle:f\\in C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M)\\}\\right\\rangle:p\\in M\\right\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathfrak X(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\coloneqq\\left\\{X\\in\\left(\\bigcup_{p\\in M}T_pM\\right)^M:\n\\mathrm{SmoothVectorField}_S(X,M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\right\\},\\\\\nX\\in\\mathfrak X(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\land f\\in C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M)\\to\nX[f]\\coloneqq\\{\\langle p,X(p)(f)\\rangle:p\\in M\\},\\\\\nX,Y\\in\\mathfrak X(M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n)\\to\n[X,Y]\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left\\langle p,\n\\{\\langle f,X(p)(Y[f])-Y(p)(X[f])\\rangle:f\\in C^\\infty_{\\mathcal A}(M)\\}\\right\\rangle:p\\in M\\right\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>向量场仍为切导子的光滑逐点赋值；补齐函数代数、方向导数和 Lie 括号的函数图，供联络及外微分沿用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lee, Introduction to Smooth Manifolds</li>\n<li>Marsden and Ratiu, Manifolds and Tensor Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved",